@startuml sequence
title: Input功能数据流时序图
' 这张图展示用户输入"1400-1530w编程"的完整处理流程

skinparam handwritten true

actor User as U
participant "FastEnterFrame" as FEF
participant "InputEnterFrame" as IEF
participant "StateMachinePresenter" as SMP
participant "stateMachineParser" as FUNC
participant "fastEnterTranslation" as FET
participant "PropertyEnterFrame" as PEF
participant "Translator" as TRANS

== 用户输入阶段 ==
U -> FEF: 键入 "1400-1530w编程"
activate FEF
FEF -> IEF: userActionHappen信号\n{rawEventType: "textChanged", text: "1400-1530w编程"}
activate IEF

== 事件类型转换 ==
IEF -> IEF: _on_FE_action_Happened()
note right: 将RawUserAction转换为UserActionType
IEF -> IEF: 构建userAction\n{eventType: "textINPUT", text: "1400-1530w编程"}

== 状态机处理 ==
IEF -> SMP: processEvent_API(userAction)
activate SMP
SMP -> SMP: parsingCurrentState()
note right: 获取当前状态 (AWAIT_START)
SMP -> FUNC: stateMachineParser(currentState, text, eventType, userAction)
activate FUNC

== 核心解析 ==
FUNC -> FET: transFastToProp_API("1400-1530w编程", actionList)
activate FET
FET -> FET: 解析时间: "1400" -> "14:00"
FET -> FET: 解析时间: "1530" -> "15:30"  
FET -> FET: 解析类型: "w" -> "work"
FET -> FET: 解析行动: "编程" (匹配actionList)
FET -> FUNC: 返回解析结果\n{data: {start:"14:00", end:"15:30", action_type:"work", action:"编程"}, nextState:"awaitaction_detail"}
deactivate FET

== 状态转换决策 ==
FUNC -> FUNC: 根据eventType决定UI行为
FUNC -> SMP: 返回suggestion\n{expectedType:"awaitaction_detail", data:{...}, suggestList:[]}
deactivate FUNC

== UI建议生成 ==
SMP -> SMP: 生成presenterAdvice
note right: 决定是否显示dropdown等
SMP -> IEF: 返回presenterAdvice\n{fastEntryText:"", data:{...}, dropdownAction:""}
deactivate SMP

== UI同步更新 ==
IEF -> PEF: fillPE(data) - 同步到属性输入框
activate PEF
note right: 使用QSignalBlocker防止循环信号
PEF -> PEF: 更新各字段显示
deactivate PEF

== 可选：属性到快速同步 ==
PEF -> IEF: propertyChanged信号 (如果用户直接修改属性)
IEF -> TRANS: properToFast(data)
activate TRANS
TRANS -> IEF: 返回快速格式文本
deactivate TRANS
IEF -> FEF: fillData(fastText) - 同步到快速输入框

== 最终提交 ==
U -> FEF: 按回车键
FEF -> IEF: userActionHappen\n{rawEventType: "returnPressed"}
IEF -> IEF: 判断为FINAL_SUBMIT事件
IEF -> SMP: processEvent_API({eventType: "finalSubmit"})
SMP -> FUNC: 最终状态转换
FUNC -> SMP: {expectedType: "complete"}
SMP -> IEF: 完成信号
IEF -> IEF: getData() - 获取最终数据
IEF -> U: finalDataSubmitted信号 (ActionUnit对象)
deactivate IEF
deactivate FEF

@enduml